---
import PageLayout from "../../layouts/PageLayout.astro";

const NAME = "The Brand Closet™";
const PRICE = "Free to join";
const NOTE = "paid tiers $9 and $19 a month, set by the owner";
const DEST = "https://www.skool.com/the-brand-closet/about?ref=97643519c9b448d0a683ab33b6cc68ce";
const AFF = true;
---
<PageLayout
  title={`${NAME} — The Digital Income Edit™`}
  description="Rose Berry's AI-fashion community on Skool: dress your AI persona in trending looks and pin them with affiliate links. Free to join."
>
  <section class="go">
    <div class="page-eyebrow">{AFF ? "Recommended · Not mine" : "From the shop"}</div>
    <h1>{NAME}</h1>
    <p class="go-lede">Rose Berry's AI-fashion community: dress your AI persona in trending looks, then pin them with affiliate links.</p>

    <div class="go-meta">
      <span class="go-price">{PRICE}</span>
      <span class="go-note">{NOTE}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="go-body">
      <p>Knowing you should post affiliate fashion pins is the easy part. Knowing what to dress her in this week is the part that stalls. The Brand Closet hands you the looks.</p>
      <p>This one isn't mine. It's Rose Berry's community on Skool, and I'm a member on the $9 tier. Joining is free; the $9 and $19 a month tiers are Rose's prices, not The Digital Income Edit™'s.</p>
      <p>Prices are set by the owner and can change without notice.</p>
    </div>


    <div class="go-good">
      <div>
        <span class="go-good-t">Good fit if</span>
        <p>You have an AI persona and want fashion looks to pin with your own affiliate links.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="go-good-t">Not a fit if</span>
        <p>You don't want to post fashion or affiliate content at all.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    {AFF && (
      <p class="go-disc">
        Affiliate link — I earn a commission if you buy through it, at no cost to you.
        I only recommend things I use.
      </p>
    )}

    <a class="btn go-btn" href={DEST} rel={AFF ? "sponsored noopener" : "noopener"}>
      Join The Brand Closet™ free <span class="a">→</span>
    </a>

    <p class="go-back"><a href="/shop">← Everything in the shop</a></p>
  </section>

  <style>
    .go{max-width:660px;margin:0 auto;padding:10px 0 70px}
    .go h1{font-family:Gloock,serif;font-weight:300;font-size:clamp(32px,5.4vw,52px);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:0;margin:0 0 20px;color:var(--choc)}
    .go-lede{font-family:Gloock,serif;font-style:italic;font-size:23px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--choc-mute);margin:0 0 26px}
    .go-meta{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;padding-bottom:26px;margin-bottom:30px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(43,22,27,.13)}
    .go-price{font-family:Gloock,serif;font-size:34px;font-weight:300;color:var(--pink);letter-spacing:-1px}
    .go-note{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.8px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--choc-meta)}
    .go-body p{font-size:17.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--choc-soft)}
    .go-good{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin:34px 0 30px}
    .go-good>div{padding:22px 24px;border-radius:2px;background:rgba(255,138,194,.1);border:1px solid rgba(214,46,115,.2)}
    .go-good>div:last-child{background:rgba(43,22,27,.035);border-color:rgba(43,22,27,.12)}
    .go-good-t{display:block;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:2.2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--pink-deep);margin-bottom:9px}
    .go-good>div:last-child .go-good-t{color:var(--choc-meta)}
    .go-good p{font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.65;margin:0;color:var(--choc)}
    .go-disc{font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--choc-mute);padding:16px 18px;border-radius:2px;
              background:rgba(232,90,155,.12);border:1px solid rgba(232,90,155,.4);margin:0 0 24px}
    .go-btn{display:inline-block}
    .go-back{margin-top:34px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.4px}
    .go-back a{color:var(--choc-meta);text-decoration:none}
    .go-back a:hover{color:var(--pink)}
    @media(max-width:640px){.go-good{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</PageLayout>
